            </div>
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-600"></span>主な用途・推奨シーン
              </span>
              <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3">
                サービスLP、Web診断受付LP、メッセージ性やキャッチコピーを最優先で直感させたいBtoB向けコーポレートトップ。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-widest flex items-center gap-1.5 pl-1 pt-1">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          実動プレビュー (Live Component)
        </div>
        <div class="border border-stone-200 rounded-sm overflow-hidden shadow-xs">
          <HeroCentered />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- #05 HeroSplit -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-stone-200/70 border border-stone-300 border-l-4 border-l-stone-900 p-5 rounded-r-sm shadow-xs">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-3 border-b border-stone-300/80">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 bg-stone-900 text-white rounded-xs">#05</span>
              <h3 class="font-mono text-base font-bold text-stone-900">HeroSplit.astro</h3>
              <button 
                type="button" 
                class="copy-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-stone-600 bg-white hover:bg-stone-900 shadow-2xs hover:text-white border border-stone-300 rounded-xs transition-colors"
                data-copy="HeroSplit.astro"
                title="ファイル名をコピー"
              >
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"/></svg>
                <span class="copy-text">名称コピー</span>
              </button>
            </div>
            <button 
              type="button" 
              class="copy-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono text-stone-700 bg-white hover:bg-stone-900 shadow-2xs hover:text-white border border-stone-300 rounded-xs transition-colors"
              data-copy="<HeroSplit />"
              title="タグをコピー"
            >
              <span class="copy-text">&lt;HeroSplit /&gt; タグコピー</span>
            </button>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs text-stone-600 pt-3">
            <div class="space-y-1">
              <span class="font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-stone-400"></span>コンポーネント概要
              </span>
              <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed pl-3">
                画面を左右に分割し、左に訴求テキストとCTA、右に高解像度写真を大胆にレイアウトしたビジュアル重視型ヒーロー。
              </p>
